One way to get the selected variation of a product that is already in the cart can be achieved through the following code:

1. Get the cart contents using the `WC() -> cart -> get_cart_contents()` method.
2. Loop through the cart contents and retrieve the product ID and corresponding variation ID (if any) using `get_product_id()` and `get_variation_id()` methods respectively.
